<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>转场</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)"}}>23 / 45</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 600, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center", padding: "0 80px"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 500, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.35, textAlign: "center"}}>可靠性解释了「它为什么不翻车」，没解释「它为什么更强」</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", gap: 8, marginTop: 30, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", textAlign: "center", lineHeight: 1.55}}>前面讲的可靠性是下限——不掉链子。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", textAlign: "center", lineHeight: 1.55}}>接下来讲的是上限——同一个模型能做成什么。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 22, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.62)", textAlign: "center", lineHeight: 1.55}}>这两件不矛盾，是同一件事的两层。</Text></Box></Box></Box>
